# Build context for the console image (web/Dockerfile).
# Source, tests and config stay in: `next build` type-checks everything tsconfig.json includes,
# and the src/**/*.test.tsx files import helpers from test/, so the image build sees exactly
# what `pnpm build` sees in CI. Only generated output and local state are left out.

node_modules
.next
out
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
*.tsbuildinfo
# written by `next build` and `next dev`
next-env.d.ts
AGENTS.md

# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE is a build argument here; a stray .env must not override it.
.env
.env.*

Dockerfile
.dockerignore
